<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-screw-dislocation-spirals-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007), Cartwright et al. (2009) & BCF (1951) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target loops, and chitin pore mineral-bridge columnar vs sheet transition — Model fidelity to source: 56/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates a static analytical Cabrera-Levine spiral phase for one isolated screw dislocation (L31-62), but lacks a 2D excitable phase-field / step-flow and chitin mineral-bridge solver for opposite-charge (+1, -1) Frank-Read closed target terraces, subcritical dipole pinch-off failure (d <= 2*r_c), sub-saturated (Delta_mu <= 0) zero-growth negative control, Voronoi polygonal tablet tessellation, and gastropod columnar vs bivalve sheet nacre reconstruction." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
